<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
  </head>
  <body>
    
        <%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Personal background section -->
<section>
    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>

    <p>
        Hello! My name is Harrison Golden, and I am studying Networking and IT Security at Ontario Tech University.
    </p>

    <p>
        I have developed an interest in technology, programming, and computer networks throughout my academic studies.
    </p>
</section>

<!-- Education and technical experience -->
<section>
    <h2>Education and Skills</h2>

    <p>
        Through my university courses, I have gained experience with Python programming, including introductory programming and object-oriented programming concepts.
    </p>

    <p>
        I have also studied networking and web development, allowing me to develop technical knowledge and problem-solving skills.
    </p>

    <h3>Technical Skills</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>Python Programming</li>
        <li>Object-Oriented Programming</li>
        <li>HTML and CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript Fundamentals</li>
        <li>Computer Networking</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<!-- Personal interests -->
<section>
    <h2>My Interests</h2>

    <p>
        Outside of university and work, I enjoy listening to music, playing video games, hiking, skiing, and practicing the piano.
    </p>

    <p>
        These activities allow me to balance my academic responsibilities with my personal interests and hobbies.
    </p>
</section>


<!-- Personal photo and video -->
<section>
    <h2>Personal Photo</h2>

    <img src="/images/Me.png"
         alt="My personal profile photo"
         width="300">
</section>

<section>
    <h2>My Piano Performance</h2>

    <p>
        One of my personal interests is playing the piano. Below is a short video of one of my performances.
    </p>

    <video controls
           poster="/Images/Piano.png"
           width="400">
        <source src="/Videos/Piano.mp4"
                type="video/mp4">
        Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
    </video>
</section>


        <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  </body>
</html>